    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1219">

                <pb facs="1443" n="1245" xml:id="pg1245"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/7–2845: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1219<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador
                        in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hurley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-28">July 28, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please deliver as soon as possible the following message to Doctor Soong: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>I understand you were to communicate with Marshal Stalin by 30th or 31st
                            July. I think it important that before that date you communicate with
                            him here through Moscow requesting opportunity to return to Moscow and
                            continue discussions in hope of reaching agreement.</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
        </body>
